\begin_layout Standard
An important observation about all the Outer loop classes, is that their
 constructors examine that global variables set for the analysis and then
 define 
\emph on
_chrom_loop
\emph default
 and 
\emph on
_trait_loop
\emph default
 (and a few others) to carry into the loop semantics whether the user desires
 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

