\begin_layout Subsection
MinGW
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
MinGW is described in 
\begin_inset Flex URL
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout

www.mingw.org
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 The download can be found at 
\begin_inset Flex URL
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout

http://www.mingw.org/download/installer
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 Once downloaded, the binaries should be added to your Windows path.
 At this point, a build of Mega2 should proceed just like a regular Unix/Linux/M
acOS build.
 You can either type 
\end_layout

\begin_layout LyX-Code
make 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
in the Mega2/srcdir directory or type
\end_layout

\begin_layout LyX-Code
install
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
in the Mega2 directory.
 The binary that is produced depends on a two .dll's that are part of the
 MinGW libraries; these .dll's must be packaged with the Mega2 binary.
 The .dlls can be found in:
\end_layout

